        { "buy": "minecraft:iron_ingot", "buyCount": 6, "sell": "onepiece:berry", "sellCount": 3 }
      ],
      "lines": ["A ship is more than wood and nails. She has a soul.", "Galley-La builds the finest ships in the world!",
